javax.portlet.description.com_liferay_password_policies_admin_web_portlet_PasswordPoliciesAdminPortlet=Password policies define enterprise level security measures which include user lockout and password expiration. Administrators can define policies or delegate to an LDAP server. (Automatic Copy)
javax.portlet.title.com_liferay_password_policies_admin_web_portlet_PasswordPoliciesAdminPortlet=Şifre Politikaları
lockout-duration=Kilitlenme Süresi
